abstract: >-
  A pre-registered study of whether the refusal behaviour of Cohere Labs' Tiny Aya Fire depends on the
  script Urdu is written in, with a matched Urdu-script / Roman-Urdu prompt set, steering vectors, and a
  negative result on script-residualized activation steering.
